1.1.0 (2026-08-21)
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/83
- Added low-memory runtime separation so the persistent startup hook does not retain the full holotape UI closure.
- Fixed repeated boot-cycle crashes reported as CALLBACK, LOW_MEMORY, and MEMORY on Pip-Boy OS 1.1.6.
- Moved hard-failsafe timing to begin after video playback starts.
- Added the NPC submenu scroll indicator.
- Added Dogmeat and Mr. House startup variants to the modular startup list.
- Kept startup audio embedded in AVI files; no separate WAV dependencies.
- Kept the targeted clean ENCLAVE_PIPBOY.AVI media fix for the 1.1.6 black-video/audio-only case.
- Removed diagnostic PIP-CO logging and runtime APPINFO self-registration from the public modular build.

